This fork adds an impact gate, stateful auth-aware detection primitives
(identity/differential, out-of-band oracle, attack-surface inventory, race
harness, business-logic testing), and an agent-proposes / harness-disposes
architecture with its measurement track. It also adds the Action Provenance
Fence (apf-provenance, apf-action-gate, apf-isolation) and its gate wiring.
See CHANGELOG.md for the full list of changes.

Modifications made by this distribution include the removal of the telemetry
transports (PostHog and Scarf), so Sagaward sends no telemetry and has no
default-on analytics path, and the removal of the managed-cloud client, so
Sagaward is local-only and runs on the user's keys. The package, CLI,
environment prefixes, home directory, and container images were renamed from
Strix to Sagaward.

